    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/9710ffb75177c2e6cb35d73d9a4be545.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/9710ffb75177c2e6cb35d73d9a4be545.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/9710ffb75177c2e6cb35d73d9a4be545.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a casual mini game where players need to use directional keys to control a car and collect gasoline on the map to increase points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/cd6ef7a4d5ef3afe6d6f0a5ce7a9db12.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/cd6ef7a4d5ef3afe6d6f0a5ce7a9db12.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/cd6ef7a4d5ef3afe6d6f0a5ce7a9db12.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pay attention to avoiding the bomber chasing you on the map. If the bomber encounters you, the game will end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/3187c94064c36d2af1fc1eba7370f50f.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/3187c94064c36d2af1fc1eba7370f50f.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/3187c94064c36d2af1fc1eba7370f50f.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When a car obtains a special item, it will evolve into a tank and be in an invincible state.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/597b63fc1ff45413fb293a545a929d2c.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/597b63fc1ff45413fb293a545a929d2c.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/597b63fc1ff45413fb293a545a929d2c.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players in tank form can turn around and eat the bombers, but note that the time spent in tank form is limited.<br><br><br>Try to eat more gasoline and bombers to earn higher game points.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/9710ffb75177c2e6cb35d73d9a4be545.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/9710ffb75177c2e6cb35d73d9a4be545.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/9710ffb75177c2e6cb35d73d9a4be545.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a casual mini game where players need to use directional keys to control a car and collect gasoline on the map to increase points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/cd6ef7a4d5ef3afe6d6f0a5ce7a9db12.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/cd6ef7a4d5ef3afe6d6f0a5ce7a9db12.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/cd6ef7a4d5ef3afe6d6f0a5ce7a9db12.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pay attention to avoiding the bomber chasing you on the map. If the bomber encounters you, the game will end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/3187c94064c36d2af1fc1eba7370f50f.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/3187c94064c36d2af1fc1eba7370f50f.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/3187c94064c36d2af1fc1eba7370f50f.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When a car obtains a special item, it will evolve into a tank and be in an invincible state.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/597b63fc1ff45413fb293a545a929d2c.poster.avif?t=1720424525\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/597b63fc1ff45413fb293a545a929d2c.webm?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474670/extras/597b63fc1ff45413fb293a545a929d2c.mp4?t=1720424525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players in tank form can turn around and eat the bombers, but note that the time spent in tank form is limited.<br><br><br>Try to eat more gasoline and bombers to earn higher game points.",
